section__
  @title "T417 - ACT6 - Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-throne/frame-417.jpg"

  "Highgarden's throne shadow falls across a hall still stacked with siege ladders and wounded men. Tyrion argues for ratifying a broad settlement before another harvest fails. Daenerys argues that compromise without deterrence invites immediate rebellion. The crown guard commanders are less philosophical: they need to know whose orders outrank whose by sunrise.

Hostage dynamics have hardened into succession leverage. A lawful ratification can stabilize the command structure and lock in explicit responsibilities for reconstruction. A covert ratification can keep dissident houses dependent on your secrets, while ensuring peace remains performative and reversible. Every concession you sign here will be cited in either coronation oaths or war crimes accusations.

The room smells of polished steel and drying blood. No one present believes there will be another neutral meeting after tonight."

  choice__
    @target "T418 - ACT6 - Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
