section__
  @title "T419 - ACT6 - The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-throne/frame-419.jpg"

  "At the Trident treaty chamber, salt-stained maps are pinned beside ledgers of burned mills and surviving granaries. Varys presents one final list of houses that will sign only if given exemptions. Sansa presents another list of villages that will starve if those exemptions stand. Quartermasters are already rationing by expected loyalty, and everyone in the room knows the game.

This is the last pact before terminal reckoning. A public oath can harden legitimacy and expose how much pain the settlement asks of ordinary households. A covert arrangement can keep elite coalitions intact and leave the countryside to absorb the hidden cost. The decision is no longer about whether conflict ends. It is about who is forced to pay for the ending.

Wax cools in the signet bowls while thunder rolls upriver. If this pact is crooked, the next act begins with funerals instead of governance."

  choice__
    @target "T420 - ACT6 - Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Sign a transparent Trident recovery pact with enforceable public obligations and audited grain commitments."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T421 - ACT6 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Lock recovery through private quotas and coercive side letters, preserving elite alignment through secrecy."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T420 - ACT6 - Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-throne/frame-420.jpg"

  "Riverrun's oath hall is crowded with claimants who swore against each other a season ago and now pretend they always expected compromise. Daenerys demands decisive closure before rivals regroup. Tyrion warns that forced closure without credible administration will produce civil collapse faster than open war did. One banner house announces it will walk unless you prove tonight that settlement terms are enforceable.

This is the final fork before the reckoning of ashes. You can impose a witnessed public settlement and carry the political burden in plain view. You can steer outcomes through covert pressure and enter the endgame with stronger leverage and weaker legitimacy. Or you can buy speed from outside partners, preserving options while deepening strategic debt that will shape every ending.

Rain beats on the river stones like distant drums. By dawn, the realm will know whether it has inherited a government, a racket, or a countdown."

  choice__
    @target "T421 - ACT6 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
